{"id":"boston","name":"波士顿","en":"Boston","country":"United States of America","lat":42.3319,"lng":-71.072,"dek":"一座在红砖与海风里反复重写的城市","history":"1630年，一批英国清教徒在约翰·温斯罗普带领下，把波士顿建在马萨诸塞湾一个通过狭窄地峡与大陆相连的半岛上。早期定居者起初称这里为三山城，后以他们其中一些人的故乡镇名——英格兰波士顿——重新命名。清教徒的道德规范很快在此落地：建城数年内，美国第一所公立学校波士顿拉丁学校和第一所大学哈佛大学先后创立。\n\n1770年代初，英国对北美十三州征税的企图在这座城市激起强烈反弹。波士顿大屠杀、波士顿倾茶事件，以及莱克星顿和康科德战役、邦克山战役、波士顿围城战，构成了美国革命早期最重要的一串事件。保罗·列维尔的午夜骑行也从这里开始。\n\n独立后，波士顿凭借距离欧洲最近的主要港口这一位置，迅速做起了朗姆酒、鱼、食盐和烟草的海外贸易，一度成为最富庶的国际商港之一。十九世纪中叶以后，铁路网推动了制造业扩张。与此同时，1820年代起抵达的爱尔兰人和意大利人逐步改变了城市的天主教面貌，肯尼迪家族便是爱尔兰裔影响波士顿政治的象征。波士顿还通过削山填海让市区面积扩大了三倍。二十世纪中后期制造业衰落，城市转向金融、医疗与教育。","culture":"波士顿的口音带有鲜明的本地气质，不发r音，与整个新英格兰地区一致。文化脉络与它的大学深度纠缠——大波士顿地区有一百多所大学，超过二十五万学生在此就读。这种密度让城市保有某种学院化的克制感，同时也没有抵消爱尔兰裔、意大利裔移民族群留下的市井传统。\n\n它习惯把自己与革命时代绑在一起：自由之路用一条嵌入地面的红线，把多处以殖民地时期为背景的历史建筑串起来。另一方面，波士顿也是硬核朋克的发源地之一，1980年代有过一场著名的演出，名字就叫“这是波士顿，不是洛杉矶”。这种混杂交叠的气质，大致就是波士顿文化的底味。","pull":"这是波士顿，不是洛杉矶。","sights":[{"name":"波士顿公园","orig":"Boston Common","intro":"美国最古老的公园，1634年建立，位于波士顿市中心，面积59英亩。它曾是放牧地和军事训练场，也是自由之路的起点，如今是城市里难得的开放绿地。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Boston_Common_Central_Burying_Ground.jpg/960px-Boston_Common_Central_Burying_Ground.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%A2%E5%A3%AB%E9%A1%BF%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD"},{"name":"三一堂","orig":"Trinity Church","intro":"波士顿最著名的教堂建筑之一，1872年大火后于1877年重建。建筑混合了法国罗马式、西班牙萨拉曼卡旧主教座堂塔楼和法国南部教堂西檐廊的样式。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Trinity_Church%2C_Boston%2C_Massachusetts_-_front_oblique_view.JPG/960px-Trinity_Church%2C_Boston%2C_Massachusetts_-_front_oblique_view.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%80%E5%A0%82_(%E6%B3%A2%E5%A3%AB%E9%A1%BF)"},{"name":"老北教堂","orig":"Old North Church","intro":"位于波士顿北区，是波士顿最古老的教堂建筑之一。1775年，保罗·列维尔正是以这里的信号灯笼为起点，开始了他的午夜骑行。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Old_North_Church_%286001949500%29.jpg/960px-Old_North_Church_%286001949500%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%80%81%E5%8C%97%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82"},{"name":"保罗·列维尔故居","orig":"Paul Revere House","intro":"在波士顿北区，一栋保存至今的十七世纪木构住宅。保罗·列维尔在这里生活，也在这里出发传递英军进兵的消息。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/2017_Paul_Revere_House_from_east.jpg/960px-2017_Paul_Revere_House_from_east.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":809},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_Revere_House"},{"name":"法尼尔厅","orig":"Faneuil Hall","intro":"殖民地时期和革命年代的重要集会场所，一楼有市场，二楼曾举行公众集会。至今每年到访人次仍以千万计。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Faneuil_Hall_Boston_Massachusetts.JPG/960px-Faneuil_Hall_Boston_Massachusetts.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1386},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%BC%E5%B0%94%E5%8E%85"}],"foods":[{"name":"新英格兰蛤蜊浓汤","orig":"New England clam chowder","intro":"以蛤蜊、浓稠奶油汤底、切丁土豆、洋葱和芹菜慢煮而成。波士顿版本不加番茄，质地厚重，常配小饼干一起食用。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Quail_07_bg_041506.jpg/960px-Quail_07_bg_041506.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clam_chowder"},{"name":"海鲜蛤蜊炸饼","orig":"Fried clams","intro":"蛤蜊去壳后裹浆油炸，是东北部海岸的经典小吃。常见于海鲜摊和简餐店，户外吃风味最正。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Fried_clams_Woodman%27s_of_Essex%2C_Massachusetts.jpg/960px-Fried_clams_Woodman%27s_of_Essex%2C_Massachusetts.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1243},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fried_clams"},{"name":"龙虾卷","orig":"Lobster roll","intro":"新英格兰式顶部切开的热狗面包里，装满黄油拌过的龙虾肉，通常冷食。讲究的版本少用美乃滋，以免盖住龙虾本味。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Connecticut_Style_Lobster_Roll.jpg/960px-Connecticut_Style_Lobster_Roll.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BE%99%E8%99%BE%E5%8D%B7"},{"name":"波士顿烤豆","orig":"Boston baked beans","intro":"白豆与糖蜜、咸猪肉或培根一同慢烤，甜咸交织。它与城市的历史联系紧密，只是如今已不太出现在本地日常菜单里。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Boston_Baked_Beans_in_Concord%2C_Mass_2012-0193.jpg/960px-Boston_Baked_Beans_in_Concord%2C_Mass_2012-0193.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boston_baked_beans"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Boston_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg/1280px-Boston_-_panoramio_%2823%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":372},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Fenway_from_Legend%27s_Box.jpg/1280px-Fenway_from_Legend%27s_Box.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":850}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-71.1912442,42.2829427],[-71.1899303,42.2812897],[-71.1853578,42.2795912],[-71.1830477,42.2758534],[-71.1774614,42.2768681],[-71.1747643,42.2758421],[-71.1747848,42.2734066],[-71.1729534,42.2702975],[-71.1745014,42.2686512],[-71.1743166,42.2671786],[-71.1716946,42.2662779],[-71.1585935,42.2551482],[-71.1523124,42.2583363],[-71.1466427,42.2557559],[-71.1426773,42.2359877],[-71.1307423,42.2279149],[-71.1275357,42.2311247],[-71.1252368,42.2320461],[-71.1245474,42.2341203],[-71.1225709,42.2344418],[-71.1263811,42.2391652],[-71.1093474,42.2479902],[-71.1095445,42.2554123],[-71.1133253,42.25899],[-71.111461,42.2607693],[-71.1089547,42.2612966],[-71.1027994,42.2597915],[-71